%[text] ### Lucas-Kanade Derivative of Gaussian (LK-DoG) Method Applied
%[text] ![](text:image:9cc3) **Try**. Use the LK-DoG method for a larger motion case of a robot moving.
%[text] ![Warning symbol](text:image:2c8d)   The LK-DoG method requires significant computational resources and may impact system performance.
%[text] 1. *Select a display mode.*
%[text] 2. *Select a starting point frame number.*
%[text] 3. *Press 'View Results of the LK-DoG Method' to see the outcome.* \
