%[text] ## Compare Optical Flow Methods
%[text] ![](text:image:1511) **Try**. Compare optical flow methods for various videos. 
%[text] 1. *(Optional) Select the preview video checkbox to watch the video.*
%[text] 2. *Select a video from the dropdown menu.*
%[text] 3. *Select an optical flow method from the dropdown menu.*
